  "limits": [
    "The candidate keeps the same upstream083861/llamabd4f bases, valid-Mel patch/frame contract, model, CPU target armv8.2-a+dotprod+fp16, preset and four-thread default. Only backend.cpp/runtime.h gain CPU pool ownership and a separate version identity.",
    "Source/nativeGGML composition, actual compiler inputs and package payload closure must be audited. All build/test/control children deny weight-format reads and network access. Construction has no model acquisition.",
    "Public C ABI control performs101failed model-construction attempts with a nonexistent readonly path. This exercises backend setup and destructor/exception cleanup; it is not successful model loading, frontend execution or neural inference.",
    "After one warmup failed construction, no observation may exceed the warmup thread count by more than two incidental system workers. Retain all101counts, errors and loader trace; do not infer long-session/RSS/publicRust qualification.",
    "Require the exact new version at the public C ABI, native diar_state CTest and strict private package loader audit. Deliver the failed-load helper binary in a safe filesystem archive so its payload can be independently rehashed.",
    "Successful construction does not promote the candidate to the Rust default. Public/native numerical parity, all lifecycle/long/concurrent/quality/platform/app/release gates remain for separate qualification."
  ]
